#Problem APEX 5.3.12

DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
Context('Numeric')->variables->are(i => 'Real');
$m = random(3, 7);
$b = random(4, 8);

@sum = ($m);
push(@sum, $_ * $m) for (2 .. $b);

$upper = Real("$b");
$term  = Formula("$m i");

BEGIN_PGML
Write the sum in summation notation, using the given
lower bound.

[```
  [@ join( '+', @sum) @] = \sum_{i=1}^{b} a_i
```]

[`b = `][_]{$upper}{5}, [`a_i = `][_]{$term}{10}
END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
Each term is 
[```
\begin{aligned}
[@ join( '+', @sum) @] & = [$m](1) + [$m](2) + [$m](3) + \cdots + [$m]([$b]) \\
  & = \sum_{i=1}^{[$b]} [$m] i.
\end{aligned}
```]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
ENDDOCUMENT();    
